  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/stoneborn_text.png?raw=true\" /> </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"> STONEBORN 是一款灵感源自奇幻媒体的简洁独特 UI 整体重制。视觉舒适，装饰适度且风格统一，适用于任何游玩体验，无论是原版还是模组整合包。</span> </span></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><em> 前方危机四伏，下次冒险不妨带上 STONEBORN！</em> </span></strong></span></p>\n<p><br /><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/line.png?raw=true\" height=\"32\" /></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">查看其他 STONEBORN 系列资源包：</span></strong></em></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stoneborn-dwarven-fantasy-inspired-ui-overhaul\"><br /> </a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/stoneborn-gear\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/CFgear.png?raw=true\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" /> </a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/stoneborn-odds-ends\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/CFOaE.png?raw=true\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" />&nbsp;</a></span></p>\n<p><br /> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/line.png?raw=true\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><em><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; color: #ff0000; text-decoration: underline;\">关于重新托管与模组兼容性的重要条款：</span></span></strong></em></span></div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">请<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">绝对不要</span>将资源包文件重新托管到 Modrinth、Planet Minecraft、CurseForge 或其他任何托管平台或论坛页面。如需推荐或链接他人下载，请直接指向本 CurseForge 页面。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">请<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">绝对不要</span>声称拥有该资源包或将其据为己有。如需在其他地方推荐或链接该资源包，请务必为我（Sindavar）提供适当的署名/致谢。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">您可以为兼容其他模组的 UI 而创建或编辑该资源包中的素材。但请注意，这些资源包仅可包含所替换模组的相关打包素材，不得包含基础的 STONEBORN 纹理包。（您的模组适配包应在游戏内作为 STONEBORN 的加载项运行）</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">您可以自由托管这些衍生包，但请务必将 STONEBORN 页面标注为依赖项，并为我添加所有适当的署名。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">您不得将 STONEBORN 与其他资源包捆绑，并在 Modrinth 或其他任何地方重新托管。我理解这对服务器等场景可能带来便利，但这会直接影响本页面的收益与下载量。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">您可以出于<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">个人使用</span>目的编辑或创建 STONEBORN 的素材，但这些修改后的文件不得以任何形式重新托管。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">若您对上述条款有任何疑问，或就重新托管/编辑资源包事宜需要咨询，请联系我。</span><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">若发现任何违规重新托管、错误署名或违反上述条款的行为，请告知我。</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/line.png?raw=true\" height=\"32\" /><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-style: italic;\">开发者说明：</span></strong></em></span></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 14px;\">我始终致力于完善作品，非常欢迎对本资源包提出建议。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 14px;\">使用非英文语言可能会导致部分文本元素无法正常显示。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 14px;\">该资源包（希望）将在 1.17 之后的未来《Minecraft》版本中持续维护。它不会支持更旧的版本。<br /></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 14px;\">欢迎在下方评论区反馈遇到的任何问题，非常感谢您的关注与支持 :)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">有问题？请在 Discord 上私信我或在 Discord 服务器中提问！</span><br /><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-size: 14px;\">- Sindavar</span><br /></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/line.png?raw=true\" height=\"32\" /> </span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">在其他平台支持我 & 加入 Discord 社群：</span></em></span></strong></span></h1>\n<p><br /><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Sindavar33\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/twitter.png?raw=true\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" /> </a> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/sindavart/\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/ig.png?raw=true\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" /> </a> <a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/sindavar/\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/pmc.png?raw=true\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" />&nbsp;</a> <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/sindavar\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/heart.png?raw=true\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" /> </a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/MF2z3KZp8Z\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/discord.png?raw=true\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" /> </a> </span><br /> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/line.png?raw=true\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/stoneborn\"> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e367a0c4-0cf1-4832-bf34-643c5b8f0742.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"150\" /> </a></span><br /> <img src=\"https://github.com/Sindavar/stoneborn-branding/blob/main/line.png?raw=true\" height=\"32\" /></p>",
